{"asset_key":"ep1/quest_story_11115240","episode":"ep1","category":"quest_story","story_id":"11115240","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:1:1111524001:0":{"text":"왜 너희만 돌아온 거야? 보물은 찾았어?","source_cn":"为什么只有你们几个回来了？你们找到宝藏了？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD46C851DD5485E2B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1111524002:0":{"text":"아빠... 아빠가 없어. 저기, 우리 아빠 못 봤어요?","source_cn":"阿爸呢……没有阿爸。请问，你们有没有见过我的阿爸？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x15339F13AFD3FE20","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1111524003:0":{"text":"우리 아빤 아메스라고 해요! 이야기하는 것과 일기 쓰는 걸 좋아하세요.","source_cn":"他叫阿米！他很喜欢讲故事，也很喜欢写日记。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1B5DCC2EF22F256C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1111524004:0":{"text":"보물을 찾는 동안 재미있었던 일들을 기록해 두었다가 저한테 들려주기로 했었는데...","source_cn":"他说他会把寻宝途中各种有趣的事情都记下来，回来后讲给我听……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1C1E390C1F9D1A5D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1111524005:0":{"text":"혹시... 혹시 우리 아빠 보신 분 있어요...?","source_cn":"有谁见过吗？有谁……见过他吗？他是我的阿爸……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1829874E04E44862","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1111524006:0":{"text":"아메스... 그 사람이라면 이미...","source_cn":"阿米……这个人不是已经——","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x414CB7A07569A85D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1111524007:0":{"text":"꼬마 아가씨... 당신의 아버지는 못 만났어요. 대신 길에서 일기장을 주웠는데, 어쩌면 당신 아버지의 것일 수도 있겠네요.","source_cn":"小姑娘……我们没有见过你阿爸，但我们在途中捡到了一些日...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x09A547DAB6184A33","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1111524008:0":{"text":"마, 맞아요! 아빠의 글씨체예요!","source_cn":"没、没错！这是阿爸的字！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x97E99EDC57647639","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1111524009:0":{"text":"그럼... 우리 아빠는...?","source_cn":"阿爸他……还好吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9E1C30635EA0BCCB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:14:1111524009":{"text":"그럼... 우리 아빠는...?","source_cn":"阿爸他……还好吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9E1C30635EA0BCCB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1111524010:0":{"text":"사실은 이미 알고 있었어요... 나쁜 예감은 항상 빗나간 적이 없었으니까요!","source_cn":"我就知道……每次遇到坏事，我的预感总是很灵！","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xC304AD501D386F16","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"사실은 이미 알고 있었어요... 나쁜 예감은 항상 빗나간 적이 없었으니까요!","female":"사실은 이미 알고 있었어요... 나쁜 예감은 항상 빗나간 적이 없었으니까요!","variant_male_record_index":"124988","variant_female_record_index":"124989","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1111524011:0":{"text":"그래서 아빠를 말렸는데, 내 말을 듣지 않았어요! 왜... 왜 항상 내 말은 무시하는 거야!","source_cn":"阿爸走的时候我就让他不要去，可他不信！为什么呢……为什...","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x4DADB3FE5EB4929A","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"그래서 아빠를 말렸는데, 내 말을 듣지 않았어요! 왜... 왜 항상 내 말은 무시하는 거야!","female":"그래서 아빠를 말렸는데, 내 말을 듣지 않았어요! 왜... 왜 항상 내 말은 무시하는 거야!","variant_male_record_index":"124990","variant_female_record_index":"124991","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:19:1111524014:0":{"text":"모두에게 진실을 알려야겠어요.","source_cn":"我得把真相告诉所有人。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1B662ECFF5022B82","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:20:1111524015:0":{"text":"아무도 악마와 블랙골드 상회가 저지른 죄에 대해 알지 못한다면 크림슨 고원에서 죽은 사람들은 목숨을 헛되이 버린 거잖아요.","source_cn":"否则那些生命只能白白沉眠于深红高地，没人知道恶魔与黑金...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB0F690F5361581F7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:21:1111524016:0":{"text":"플루스토가 말한 것처럼, 그의 죄를 아무도 모른다면, 우리가 나서서 모두에게 알리고 그들에게 심판할 권리를 줘야 해요!","source_cn":"正如普鲁斯托所言，必须有人知道他的罪行，我们要让世人获...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7DC9CED8998F727B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:23:1111524017:0":{"text":"내가 사트라나와 함께 유품의 주인을 찾아볼게.","source_cn":"我会帮助萨忒娜，试着为带回的遗物寻找失主。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x966B845C28293134","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:24:1111524018:0":{"text":"유품을 보면 유가족들도 우리의 말을 믿어줄 거야.","source_cn":"看到那些遗物，家属应该会知道我们所言非虚。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2CA77DC35CD33D53","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:26:1111524019:0":{"text":"나도 도울게! 사트라나 언니랑 안탄드라 언니만 고생하게 둘 순 없지!","source_cn":"我也要帮忙。不能只让萨忒娜姐姐和安丹姐姐出力！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x98A5F8491645639F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:30:1111524020:0":{"text":"나도 일단은 남아 있어야겠군.","source_cn":"我也暂时留下来好了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF89A3A297F56AE27","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:31:1111524021:0":{"text":"호의는 고맙지만, 당신은 빨리 부족원에게 돌아가는 게 좋겠어요.","source_cn":"谢谢你的好意，但你还是赶紧回到族人身边吧。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xECDEA7946D4EB40F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_f